 60GA2cP 76 ms {I3} (2017Ku12), 70.8 ms {I20} (2017GoZT,2020Gi02), 69.4 ms {I2} 
 60GA3cP (2021Or01), and 57.7 ms {I98} (2025Ow01).                              
 60GA cP QP$deduced by evaluators using {+60}Zn mass excess of -54174.5 {I5}    
